# abs_dvisns_ISNS_P: pin ISNS_P (ISNS_P) within the limit, x derate
#   Differential DC input voltage (VSENSE = VISNS_P - VISNS_N): max 3.3 V (max_ref rel. ISNS_N)
#   DS p.5, Table 2. Absolute maximum ratings, Differential DC input voltage (VSENSE = VISNS_P - VISNS_N)
#   Severity error: abs_max violated
